Package: polaris-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: PolarisOS archive key and APT source
 Installs the public key that signs the PolarisOS APT repository and the
 APT source (/etc/apt/sources.list.d/polarisos.sources), so installed
 systems receive updates of the polaris-* packages with apt.
